{#
    Sylius' thank you page shows the instructions of the order's last payment, such as where to send a bank transfer.
    The gift card payments are added when the order is placed, after the payment the customer chose for the rest, so
    on an order the gift cards pay in part the last payment is a gift card payment and the instructions for the rest
    would never be shown. Sylius fires no template event around its instructions, so the instructions for the rest are
    rendered here, built like Sylius' own, on the event right above them (see SetonoSyliusGiftCardExtension::prepend()).

    Where the payment for the rest is the order's last payment, Sylius shows its instructions itself.
#}
{% set remaining_payment = setono_gift_card_remaining_payment(order) %}
{% if remaining_payment is not null and remaining_payment is not same as(order.payments.last()) and remaining_payment.method.instructions is not null %}
    <div id="sylius-payment-method-instructions" class="ui segment" {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('payment-method-instructions') }}>
        {{ remaining_payment.method.instructions }}
    </div>
{% endif %}
